language ESSENCE' 1.0

given n: int(1..)
given k: int(1..)
find S_Explicit: matrix indexed by [int(1..k)] of int(1..n)
branching on [S_Explicit]
such that
    and([and([S_Explicit[q3] + S_Explicit[q4] <= n ->
              !or([S_Explicit[q6] = S_Explicit[q3] + S_Explicit[q4] | q6 : int(1..k)])
                  | q4 : int(1..k)])
             | q3 : int(1..k)]),
    and([S_Explicit[q1] < S_Explicit[q1 + 1] | q1 : int(1..k - 1)])

